<title>TUNISIA: Arab Tunisian Bank reports first-half profits.</title>
<headline>Arab Tunisian Bank reports first-half profits.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arab Tunisian Bank  ATB on Friday said its net profit during the first half of 1996 amounted to 3.629 million dinars.</p>
<p>It was the first time the bank published a mid-year result.</p>
<p>ATB made a 6.46 million dinars net during the whole 1995 year.</p>
<p>It has a capital of 35 million dinars.  ($=0.96 dinar)</p>
</text>
